{'symbol': 'TSLA', 'date': '2023-03-15 14:21:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, A HIGHLY RECOGNIZED LAW FIRM, ENCOURAGES TESLA, INC. INVESTORS TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - TSLA', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MARCH 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF TESLA, INC. (NASDAQ: TSLA) BETWEEN FEBRUARY 19, 2019 AND FEBRUARY 17, 2023, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT APRIL 28, 2023 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE. \xa0 SO WHAT:\xa0IF YOU PURCHASED TESLA SECURITIES DURING THE CLASS PERIOD YOU MAY BE ENTITLED TO COMPENSATION WITHOUT PAYMENT OF ANY OUT OF POCKET FEES OR COSTS THROUGH A CONTINGENCY FEE ARRANGEMENT.'}